WEBVTT

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:36.890 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:39.870 line:0%
[Episode 11]

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:41.640 line:0%
Oh, Xing.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.839 line:0%
What am I supposed to say to you?

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:46.800 line:0%
Your heartfelt plea just now

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:48.160 line:0%
showed your loyalty to our Ministry of Justice.

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:49.720 line:0%
It was as clear as the sun in the sky,

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:50.960 line:0%
truly moving.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.880 line:0%
But to speak like that in front of Lord Lai,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.320 line:0%
it was far too bold.

00:01:56.559 --> 00:01:57.400 line:0%
That's the

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:00.070 line:0%
Black Rakshasa.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.000 line:0%
My Lord.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.410 line:0%
Yes, Xing,

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.560 line:0%
my heart is still racing from fear.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.760 line:0%
Do you really think you're

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:07.160 line:0%
some kind of dominatrix?

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:07.830 line:0%
Well,

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.430 line:0%
the thing is, even if the Black Rakshasa

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:11.280 line:0%
encountered demons and evil spirits,

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.080 line:0%
he could

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.480 line:0%
cut out their heart and eat it.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.120 line:0%
Tell me,

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.680 line:0%
why should we provoke him?

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:18.560 line:0%
Princess Ying has arrived.

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:23.879 line:0%
Greetings, Your Highness.

00:02:23.879 --> 00:02:25.410 line:0%
Greetings, Your Highness.

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:44.650 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, you're wise,

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.800 line:0%
attentive in investigating cases,

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:48.520 line:0%
and adept at managing the household.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:49.670 line:0%
You are truly

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.680 line:0%
a rare female talent.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:56.000 line:0%
Our dynasty encourages women to enter officialdom,

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.890 line:0%
allowing women to become generals and ministers.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.650 line:0%
Madam Grand Commander,

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.640 line:0%
you are indeed a role model in this regard.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.170 line:0%
Thank you for your kind words, Your Highness.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.280 line:0%
May I ask the purpose

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.490 line:0%
of your visit today?

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.570 line:0%
Last night, Chen Huo'e came back to life.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.530 line:0%
This morning,

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.110 line:0%
Lord Lai requested from Her Majesty

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.480 line:0%
the authority to investigate the case.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:26.840 line:0%
This case is intricate and complex.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.280 line:0%
I assume the Ministry of Justice

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:32.240 line:0%
would prefer not to get entangled in it.

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.120 line:0%
This case

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.560 line:0%
was originally under the jurisdiction of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.690 line:0%
Now that Lord Lai is reinvestigating,

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.560 line:0%
our Ministry of Justice has no authority to interfere,

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:41.520 line:0%
nor do we dare to.

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:45.890 line:0%
However, Yan Xing,

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.720 line:0%
besides being a scribe in the Ministry of Justice,

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:51.180 line:0%
you are also the wife of the Grand Commander.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.140 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, I've heard that you

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.980 line:0%
are quite skilled in managing your husband.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:07.160 line:0%
If you

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.080 line:0%
could persuade your husband

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.000 line:0%
not to get involved in this case,

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:13.400 line:0%
and if you could also restrain your own curiosity

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.740 line:0%
and remain a bystander,

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.680 line:0%
I would be willing

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:17.870 line:0%
to do you a favor.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.000 line:0%
I would personally request

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.230 line:0%
an imperial decree from Her Majesty

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.880 line:0%
to allow your third sister and Han Shiyuan

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.040 line:0%
to become a married couple.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.090 line:0%
I am quite busy, you know.

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:54.000 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, I hope you can give me an answer soon.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:54.959 line:0%
Alright?

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.240 line:0%
Xing.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.010 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:21.400 line:0%
You originally had nothing to do with that case.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:22.400 line:0%
You just need

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.840 line:0%
to properly

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.120 line:0%
persuade the Grand Commander.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.400 line:0%
Then your Yan family

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:27.760 line:0%
could receive two

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.920 line:0%
marriage contracts bestowed by the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.760 line:0%
That would bring such great honor to your ancestors

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.190 line:0%
and glory to your family name.

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:35.400 line:0%
What were you hesitating about?

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:36.080 line:0%
Why didn't you

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.400 line:0%
agree immediately just now?

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.200 line:0%
Princess Yong'an and Lord Lai

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:40.360 line:0%
clearly don't want

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.360 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau and the Ministry of Justice to be involved in this case.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.600 line:0%
But the more they act like this,

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.680 line:0%
the more guilty they seem, don't they?

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.000 line:0%
And logically speaking,

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.160 line:0%
Princess Yong'an

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.600 line:0%
has just been cleared of suspicion

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.080 line:0%
in the Buddha's Sin-Absolving case.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.520 line:0%
So why is she in such a hurry

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:54.520 line:0%
to wade into these troubled waters?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:55.870 line:0%
Xing,

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:58.500 line:0%
this is clearly a bloody pit.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.360 line:0%
We should be running away from it,

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.520 line:0%
you're not really thinking of jumping in, are you?

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:03.320 line:0%
Chuichui...

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.880 line:0%
Yan Xing!

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:09.560 line:0%
You are the wife of the Grand Commander.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.200 line:0%
I can't control what trouble you're getting into.

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:13.960 line:0%
But don't you dare

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.400 line:0%
involve the Ministry of Justice

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.160 line:0%
in this matter in any way.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.720 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.320 line:0%
won't go down with you.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:28.240 line:0%
Director.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.400 line:0%
Her Majesty's close confidant,

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:31.900 line:0%
Zhang Baohuan, Deputy Minister,

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.400 line:0%
has just alighted from his sedan chair outside the Ministry of Justice.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.240 line:0%
He says

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.360 line:0%
he requests to speak with Miss Yan.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:52.000 line:0%
My Lady,

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:53.720 line:0%
don't bring me

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.200 line:0%
all these troubles.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:59.640 line:0%
Our Ministry of Justice is too small to handle this.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:22.720 line:0%
Lord Yan.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.260 line:0%
I know you are busy,

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:32.160 line:0%
but I hope you don't mind

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:34.040 line:0%
me visiting today.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:36.510 line:0%
I wouldn't dare to mind, sir.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.920 line:0%
The reason for my visit today

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:41.520 line:0%
is not for any major inquiry.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:43.100 line:0%
I just wanted to ask

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.980 line:0%
how Han Shiyuan has been

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.240 line:0%
doing recently.

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:49.560 line:0%
Mr. Han

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.700 line:0%
returned to the Yan's Mansion with my third sister last night.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.080 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau didn't give him any trouble.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:56.080 line:0%
I went to the Yan's Mansion today,

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.680 line:0%
but was told he wasn't there.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.040 line:0%
It seems

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.170 line:0%
he still doesn't want to see me.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.520 line:0%
May I ask what connection you have

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.040 line:0%
with Mr. Han?

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.160 line:0%
It's nothing,

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.560 line:0%
we're just old acquaintances.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.840 line:0%
Since Han Shiyuan

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.200 line:0%
has won the favor of the Yan family's Third Miss,

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.640 line:0%
it's his good fortune.

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:26.600 line:0%
In the future,

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:28.920 line:0%
if you have the chance, please

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:31.020 line:0%
look after him in your household.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.080 line:0%
Of course.

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:35.640 line:0%
Well then,

00:08:36.709 --> 00:08:38.440 line:0%
I won't disturb you any longer.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.080 line:0%
I'll take my leave now.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:55.720 line:0%
Han Shiyuan is very secretive about his relationship

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.160 line:0%
with Zhang Baohuan

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.420 line:0%
and Princess Yong'an.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.280 line:0%
Behind Chen Huo'e's resurrection,

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:02.410 line:0%
there seem to be many forces involved.

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:03.800 line:0%
It even involves

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.400 line:0%
my third sister's marriage.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.320 line:0%
Even Lai Luozhi wants to interfere in this matter.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:09.410 line:0%
Now,

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.720 line:0%
it seems everyone wants

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.240 line:0%
me to stay out of it.

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:14.080 line:0%
What should I do?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.130 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.560 line:0%
Xing, you're here.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:33.580 line:0%
Sister Caiwei.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:34.920 line:0%
Mr. Han.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:39.320 line:0%
I should thank

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.440 line:0%
you and the Grand Commander for last night.

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:42.360 line:0%
Why did you specially bring gifts today?

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.240 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.810 line:0%
I'm afraid you're here to interrogate us.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.160 line:0%
About last night's incident,

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:51.800 line:0%
Shiyuan and I

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.400 line:0%
really don't know anything.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.210 line:0%
Don't worry, Sister Caiwei.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:56.160 line:0%
The case from last night

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.680 line:0%
will surely come to light.

00:09:58.560 --> 00:09:59.910 line:0%
I just want to know,

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.040 line:0%
Mr. Han,

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.120 line:0%
about you, Deputy Minister Zhang, and Princess Yong'an,

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.920 line:0%
what's the relationship between the three of you?

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:08.800 line:0%
I can't tell you.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.200 line:0%
At a time like this,

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.240 line:0%
you still can't tell me?

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.200 line:0%
If it weren't for you,

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.000 line:0%
how could my sister

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.040 line:0%
suffer so much?

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.260 line:0%
Don't pressure Shiyuan anymore.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:18.600 line:0%
I believe him.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.720 line:0%
Xing, you're back.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:28.960 line:0%
Mother.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.820 line:0%
Don't you have to be on duty today?

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.480 line:0%
You must be worried about those gifts,

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.240 line:0%
wanting to go

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.280 line:0%
to your third sister's place to check,

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.040 line:0%
right?

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:38.640 line:0%
Let me tell you,

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.280 line:0%
this time, your husband

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.280 line:0%
has done a very thorough job.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.480 line:0%
I'm also

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:45.040 line:0%
riding on the coattails.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:45.840 line:0%
Gift?

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:48.040 line:0%
Sister Caiwei just mentioned sending gifts.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.800 line:0%
What on earth are you talking about?

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.040 line:0%
Don't you know?

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.520 line:0%
This morning, the Shen family sent someone to express their concern.

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.200 line:0%
They said you were worried that your third sister

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.440 line:0%
was frightened last night.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.080 line:0%
They specially sent

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:59.040 line:0%
a bunch of tonic gifts.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:01.000 line:0%
I could tell from the lavish gesture

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:01.600 line:0%
that

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:04.000 line:0%
it must have been paid for by my son-in-law.

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:05.280 line:0%
Oh, right,

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:06.520 line:0%
the kitchen is stewing some tonics.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.080 line:0%
Let's go.

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.240 line:0%
I'll get you a bowl.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.320 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:12.300 line:0%
I can't believe he did all this behind my back.

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:13.880 line:0%
Why would he suddenly be so enthusiastic

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.000 line:0%
about our family?

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.340 line:0%
Isn't it obvious?

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.720 line:0%
It must be because of you.

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:20.880 line:0%
Otherwise, why would the Grand Commander

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.240 line:0%
care about the small Yan family?

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:28.920 line:0%
That stinky boy.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.320 line:0%
Does he still have ulterior motives,

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.980 line:0%
pining for your third sister?

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:34.800 line:0%
Your third sister

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.200 line:0%
is the talented lady of Xiang'an after all.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:39.190 line:0%
She does seem more

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.020 line:0%
desirable than you.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.480 line:0%
No, no,

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.600 line:0%
this tendency

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.040 line:0%
must be nipped in the bud.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.530 line:0%
I'll go persuade your father tonight

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.400 line:0%
to quickly arrange

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:53.760 line:0%
the marriage between Caiwei and Han Shiyuan.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.120 line:0%
We need to make sure they

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.240 line:0%
seal the deal as soon as possible.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:58.130 line:0%
Mother,

00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.000 line:0%
what are you always

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:00.400 line:0%
thinking about?

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.420 line:0%
Has that White Ghost

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:04.090 line:0%
been hitting you recently?

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.010 line:0%
Have you two been arguing lately?

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.410 line:0%
Let me tell you,

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.690 line:0%
you can't let your guard down.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.260 line:0%
You must keep a close eye on him,

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:15.610 line:0%
and never slack off.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:18.270 line:0%
Alright, Mother, I understand.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.800 line:0%
I'm suddenly feeling a bit hungry.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.800 line:0%
Why don't you go get me a bowl of soup?

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.240 line:0%
I almost forgot again.

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:25.280 line:0%
Wait here.

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:41.930 line:0%
[Reviving Elegant Music]

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.580 line:0%
What a fine zither.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.320 line:0%
What a beautiful melody.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.050 line:0%
Such wonderful artistic conception.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:08.840 line:0%
The piece Jin Zang played today

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.920 line:0%
seems different from before.

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.960 line:0%
It has a touch of Zen to it,

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:20.280 line:0%
making one feel refreshed upon hearing it.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.880 line:0%
This is an ancient elegant music

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.040 line:0%
Palace Steward Xu found.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:32.440 line:0%
When I visited the temple to pay respects to Buddha a few days ago,

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:34.360 line:0%
a senior monk gifted me a musical score.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.480 line:0%
It's said to have the effect of clearing the mind.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.280 line:0%
So I asked Musician Jin

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.480 line:0%
to play it elegantly.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.200 line:0%
Indeed, it's marvelous.

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.760 line:0%
I remember

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.160 line:0%
back then,

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:54.110 line:0%
you personally went up the mountain to dig lingzhi mushrooms

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.200 line:0%
and gave them to me,

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.520 line:0%
asking me to treat the Shen family's case leniently

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.120 line:0%
and give a lighter sentence,

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:03.880 line:0%
releasing young Shen Du from prison.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.190 line:0%
So today,

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.800 line:0%
what is your request?

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.780 line:0%
I wouldn't dare, Your Majesty.

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:14.890 line:0%
Summon him in then.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.590 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:27.880 line:0%
I know why you're here.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:29.990 line:0%
Lord Lai

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:33.240 line:0%
requested a retrial of Chen Huo'e's case.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:34.480 line:0%
This case,

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:36.740 line:0%
although recently investigated by you,

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:38.720 line:0%
was after all handled by him

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.320 line:0%
five years ago.

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.450 line:0%
He admits his negligence

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.640 line:0%
and now wishes to make amends for his mistakes.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.920 line:0%
It's only human nature.

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:49.720 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:51.040 line:0%
I believe

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:52.920 line:0%
the dead cannot be brought back to life.

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:54.160 line:0%
The Chen Huo'e from back then

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.560 line:0%
may not be the same as the recent Chen Huo'e.

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:04.940 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:08.050 line:0%
since you're unwell,

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:10.520 line:0%
there's no need to force yourself.

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:12.680 line:0%
It's just a minor injury.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.120 line:0%
I've already recovered.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:17.250 line:0%
Very well.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.840 line:0%
Since Palace Steward Xu has vouched for you,

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:23.480 line:0%
the Chen Huo'e case

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:27.280 line:0%
will be handed over to the Imperial Security Bureau for investigation.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.340 line:0%
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.250 line:0%
In that case,

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.640 line:0%
the matter concerning the Hongwen Academy scholars

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.900 line:0%
will be handled by Prime Minister Zhang.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.240 line:0%
After all, he is a civil official

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.080 line:0%
and will find it easier

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.010 line:0%
to communicate with the scholars.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.440 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:47.160 line:0%
you will be responsible for the recent security of the capital.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.290 line:0%
How does that sound?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.000 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.640 line:0%
The security of the capital is of utmost importance.

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:53.680 line:0%
We cannot afford any mistakes.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.160 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau is short-staffed.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.720 line:0%
I'm afraid it will be difficult to ensure comprehensive protection.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.080 line:0%
You clever monkey!

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:02.320 line:0%
Usually, you only complain about not having enough power.

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:03.520 line:0%
But today,

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.890 line:0%
you're making excuses.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:06.920 line:0%
Do you think I

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:08.820 line:0%
don't know what you're thinking?

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.000 line:0%
I wouldn't dare, Your Majesty.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:13.960 line:0%
Wouldn't dare?

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:16.840 line:0%
I think you're all plotting against me.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.920 line:0%
You've got some nerve!

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:23.000 line:0%
-Your Majesty, please calm down.
-Your Majesty. Please forgive me.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.120 line:0%
Enough, enough.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.040 line:0%
Since I've entrusted you with the capital's security,

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:29.280 line:0%
I will naturally give you

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:31.840 line:0%
the authority to mobilize resources from various places.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.050 line:0%
During the examination period at the Hongwen Academy,

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.110 line:0%
for all matters related to security,

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.240 line:0%
personnel from all regions

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:40.010 line:0%
will be at your disposal.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.290 line:0%
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.100 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.760 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang has already taken control of the Hongwen Academy.

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:58.820 line:0%
That old bastard.

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:01.240 line:0%
He has gotten ahead of us again.

00:17:08.889 --> 00:17:10.659 line:0%
Now this is interesting.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:18.379 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:19.869 line:0%
Mentor.

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:20.889 line:0%
You've come at the perfect time.

00:17:20.889 --> 00:17:23.000 line:0%
Take a look at my Imperial Yellow Peony.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.240 line:0%
Isn't it blooming beautifully?

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.560 line:0%
Yes, it's beautiful.

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:27.720 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.120 line:0%
this time, Her Majesty

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:30.960 line:0%
allows me to handle

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:32.760 line:0%
the matter of the Hongwen Academy examination.

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:33.960 line:0%
These scholars of the Hongwen Academy

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.640 line:0%
are the finest students in the land.

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:37.480 line:0%
With their achievements in this examination,

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:38.360 line:0%
Your Highness

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.800 line:0%
will have a higher chance

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.900 line:0%
of obtaining the position of Regent.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:42.800 line:0%
Mentor,

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:44.760 line:0%
whether it's I

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:46.600 line:0%
or Princess Ying who becomes Regent in the future,

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:47.400 line:0%
we are all serving

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:49.360 line:0%
Her Majesty and His Majesty.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.440 line:0%
Your Highness, I must respectfully disagree with your statement.

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:53.440 line:0%
His Majesty is slow of speech,

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.040 line:0%
Her Majesty is advanced in years,

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:55.760 line:0%
and the Regent

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.000 line:0%
is of utmost importance to the foundation of the Cang State.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.160 line:0%
In this matter,

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.840 line:0%
Your Highness must not be negligent.

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:05.280 line:0%
Mentor, you have worked hard on this.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.960 line:0%
It's crucial to correct everyone's misunderstandings

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.800 line:0%
and make the vast number of scholars from humble backgrounds

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:09.440 line:0%
feel

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.570 line:0%
our genuine care and respect for them.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:16.370 line:0%
Yes, yes, indeed.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.400 line:0%
That is natural.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.160 line:0%
However,

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.960 line:0%
this time Shen Du has again been given

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.280 line:0%
the responsibility for the capital's security,

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:23.940 line:0%
gaining additional authority without reason.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.880 line:0%
Lord Shen is indeed capable.

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:29.480 line:0%
No matter what kind of situation

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:31.080 line:0%
this person encounters,

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.930 line:0%
or what kind of trouble arises,

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:35.720 line:0%
he always has a way to deal with it.

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:37.560 line:0%
Mentor,

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:39.800 line:0%
what do you think?

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:42.650 line:0%
Your Highness is right.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.480 line:0%
As for this Shen Du,

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.360 line:0%
now that he's in charge of the capital's security,

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:47.400 line:0%
shouldn't the situation in Xiang'an

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:48.120 line:0%
be

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:50.120 line:0%
more chaotic and lively?

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:51.660 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:54.520 line:0%
should we lend him a hand?

00:18:58.160 --> 00:18:59.520 line:0%
What did you just say?

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:04.800 line:0%
You may go now.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.280 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:32.840 line:0%
The responsibility for the imperial examination at Hongwen Academy

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:34.320 line:0%
has ultimately been entrusted to Prime Minister Zhang.

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.640 line:0%
Her Majesty has assigned the security of the capital

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:36.480 line:0%
to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:37.800 line:0%
Is this meant as a gesture of appeasement?

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:40.060 line:0%
This is precisely the outcome I desired.

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.970 line:0%
You don't seem disappointed at all.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.520 line:0%
A storm is brewing.

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:47.880 line:0%
During the imperial examination at Hongwen Academy,

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:48.920 line:0%
Princess Ying, Prince Xian,

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:50.080 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang, and Lai Luozhi will surely

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.650 line:0%
make their moves.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:52.760 line:0%
Keep a close eye on them.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:53.570 line:0%
Yes.

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:55.680 line:0%
The security around Hongwen Academy

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:56.660 line:0%
cannot be underestimated.

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:57.360 line:0%
We can deploy

00:19:57.360 --> 00:20:00.160 line:0%
the Imperial Guards and the constables to assist.

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:01.680 line:0%
Also, the security of the Three Departments and Six Ministries

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:02.940 line:0%
cannot be overlooked.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.670 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau will personally keep a close watch.

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:07.840 line:0%
Especially...

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:10.780 line:0%
on Lintai.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:12.840 line:0%
Understood.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.080 line:0%
Who is it?

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.560 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.080 line:0%
Thank you for the gifts

00:20:59.080 --> 00:20:59.600 line:0%
you sent to my third sister and the others.

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:00.760 line:0%
They all loved them.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:03.630 line:0%
It's nothing.

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.980 line:0%
At today's court session,

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:11.260 line:0%
was there anything interesting?

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.400 line:0%
Nothing much,

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:13.920 line:0%
except Lai Luozhi came

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.610 line:0%
to request the authority to investigate the Chen Huo'e case.

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:18.340 line:0%
Did Her Majesty grant it to him?

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:27.690 line:0%
She gave it to me.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:28.600 line:0%
You...

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.120 line:0%
You mean the Chen Huo'e case

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:38.160 line:0%
will still be handled by the Imperial Security Bureau?

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:39.390 line:0%
That's great!

00:21:49.770 --> 00:21:51.430 line:0%
I'll go grind some ink for you.

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:49.920 line:0%
No matter how you tidy up a doghouse,

00:22:49.920 --> 00:22:51.490 line:0%
it's still a doghouse.

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:17.620 line:0%
How's

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:20.940 line:0%
your hand?

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:28.130 line:0%
It was bitten by a puppy.

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:30.210 line:0%
It won't heal that quickly.

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:52.740 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:56.000 line:0%
Take a look at the case files.

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.120 line:0%
Take a break.

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:59.120 line:0%
Would you like me to cook for you?

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:00.710 line:0%
You know how to cook?

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:02.320 line:0%
Don't underestimate me.

00:24:02.320 --> 00:24:04.770 line:0%
I am the great Yan Xing after all.

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:08.800 line:0%
Yes.

00:24:09.200 --> 00:24:10.560 line:0%
A talent for poetry.

00:24:12.640 --> 00:24:15.220 line:0%
Your writing is like a dance, depicting phoenixes with grace.

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:18.300 line:0%
You're well-versed in classics and contemporary knowledge.

00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:20.560 line:0%
Your reputation as a virtuous lady

00:24:20.720 --> 00:24:22.520 line:0%
is unmatched in Xiang'an...

00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:44.010 line:0%
Let's go.

00:24:45.900 --> 00:24:46.560 line:0%
Hurry.

00:24:58.570 --> 00:24:59.700 line:0%
Please, have a seat.

00:25:06.440 --> 00:25:07.280 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:25:07.280 --> 00:25:09.000 line:0%
I cooked all these dishes myself.

00:25:09.000 --> 00:25:09.930 line:0%
Please try them.

00:25:21.740 --> 00:25:23.260 line:0%
Try this chicken.

00:25:40.200 --> 00:25:41.000 line:0%
How is it?

00:25:42.420 --> 00:25:43.530 line:0%
Surprisingly,

00:25:47.460 --> 00:25:48.470 line:0%
it's not bad.

00:25:52.010 --> 00:25:53.140 line:0%
See? See?

00:25:53.400 --> 00:25:54.480 line:0%
I told you,

00:25:54.720 --> 00:25:56.200 line:0%
the principles of cooking and autopsy

00:25:56.200 --> 00:25:57.650 line:0%
are quite similar.

00:25:57.790 --> 00:25:58.880 line:0%
Using preservation

00:25:58.880 --> 00:26:00.320 line:0%
and autopsy techniques

00:26:00.320 --> 00:26:01.440 line:0%
to process this chicken

00:26:01.440 --> 00:26:02.360 line:0%
results in a texture

00:26:02.360 --> 00:26:04.620 line:0%
just like freshly slaughtered chicken.

00:26:08.200 --> 00:26:09.000 line:0%
Right.

00:26:18.390 --> 00:26:20.150 line:0%
Try this soup now.

00:26:40.690 --> 00:26:42.560 line:0%
The inspiration for these spices

00:26:42.560 --> 00:26:43.200 line:0%
comes from

00:26:43.200 --> 00:26:45.470 line:0%
Mrs. Tang's corpse-pickling spices.

00:26:46.150 --> 00:26:47.120 line:0%
Take a whiff.

00:26:47.120 --> 00:26:48.440 line:0%
Isn't the aroma overwhelming?

00:26:48.440 --> 00:26:49.240 line:0%
Isn't it?

00:26:49.310 --> 00:26:50.440 line:0%
Smells good, right?

00:27:16.050 --> 00:27:17.130 line:0%
What do you want?

00:27:20.550 --> 00:27:21.640 line:0%
Just say it.

00:27:24.000 --> 00:27:25.980 line:0%
I've succeeded so quickly?

00:27:32.990 --> 00:27:34.830 line:0%
I wanted to say...

00:27:37.720 --> 00:27:39.820 line:0%
Can I be involved in

00:27:40.280 --> 00:27:41.440 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's case?

00:27:41.440 --> 00:27:42.240 line:0%
No.

00:27:44.720 --> 00:27:45.440 line:0%
Can't you see

00:27:45.440 --> 00:27:47.100 line:0%
how complicated this case is?

00:27:48.100 --> 00:27:49.040 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice and the Court of Judicial Review

00:27:49.040 --> 00:27:50.120 line:0%
are both trying to avoid it at all costs.

00:27:50.120 --> 00:27:52.080 line:0%
And here you are, asking to be involved.

00:27:52.080 --> 00:27:53.080 line:0%
I know.

00:27:53.840 --> 00:27:55.360 line:0%
Lai Luozhi and Princess Yong'an

00:27:55.360 --> 00:27:56.800 line:0%
both came to see me today.

00:27:57.000 --> 00:27:58.080 line:0%
Directly and indirectly,

00:27:58.080 --> 00:27:58.840 line:0%
they just don't want me

00:27:58.840 --> 00:28:00.440 line:0%
to get involved in this case.

00:28:00.600 --> 00:28:01.560 line:0%
But I'm just

00:28:01.560 --> 00:28:02.680 line:0%
a lowly scribe.

00:28:02.680 --> 00:28:04.360 line:0%
Are they really afraid of me?

00:28:04.760 --> 00:28:06.020 line:0%
What they're afraid of

00:28:06.120 --> 00:28:08.080 line:0%
is just my title as Mrs. Shen.

00:28:12.350 --> 00:28:13.780 line:0%
Since you already know.

00:28:14.270 --> 00:28:16.350 line:0%
You've already taken on this case.

00:28:16.760 --> 00:28:17.950 line:0%
Now,

00:28:18.080 --> 00:28:19.240 line:0%
I can't escape my role

00:28:19.240 --> 00:28:20.160 line:0%
as Mrs. Shen.

00:28:20.200 --> 00:28:21.560 line:0%
How can I stay

00:28:21.560 --> 00:28:22.800 line:0%
completely uninvolved?

00:28:22.800 --> 00:28:24.280 line:0%
If you encounter danger,

00:28:24.310 --> 00:28:26.040 line:0%
how can I stay out of it?

00:28:37.230 --> 00:28:38.220 line:0%
I apologize.

00:28:38.740 --> 00:28:40.670 line:0%
There's nothing to apologize for.

00:28:41.020 --> 00:28:42.230 line:0%
Uncovering the truth

00:28:42.320 --> 00:28:43.240 line:0%
and clearing people's names

00:28:43.240 --> 00:28:44.800 line:0%
has always been my ideal.

00:28:47.330 --> 00:28:48.520 line:0%
I only ask

00:28:48.520 --> 00:28:49.200 line:0%
that you give me

00:28:49.200 --> 00:28:50.930 line:0%
the authority to investigate.

00:28:53.300 --> 00:28:54.320 line:0%
Don't worry,

00:28:54.320 --> 00:28:55.880 line:0%
I absolutely won't hold you back.

00:28:55.880 --> 00:28:57.940 line:0%
I won't become a burden to you either.

00:29:10.940 --> 00:29:13.150 line:0%
[Imperial Security Bureau]

00:29:18.920 --> 00:29:20.720 line:0%
But you have to promise me first.

00:29:20.760 --> 00:29:21.520 line:0%
in this case,

00:29:21.520 --> 00:29:22.740 line:0%
if anything happens,

00:29:22.930 --> 00:29:23.920 line:0%
you must consult with me

00:29:23.920 --> 00:29:24.860 line:0%
before making any decisions.

00:29:24.860 --> 00:29:26.280 line:0%
Do not act on your own under any circumstances.

00:29:26.280 --> 00:29:27.230 line:0%
Of course.

00:29:27.250 --> 00:29:28.610 line:0%
You are the Grand Commander,

00:29:28.610 --> 00:29:29.810 line:0%
my superior.

00:29:29.830 --> 00:29:32.290 line:0%
Naturally, I'll follow your instructions.

00:29:32.810 --> 00:29:34.160 line:0%
From now on,

00:29:34.160 --> 00:29:35.880 line:0%
I will obey only the Grand Commander's orders.

00:29:35.880 --> 00:29:36.810 line:0%
Is that alright?

00:29:42.750 --> 00:29:43.760 line:0%
Nonsense.

00:29:50.330 --> 00:29:51.870 line:0%
[Imperial Security Bureau]

00:30:01.740 --> 00:30:04.530 line:0%
[Chen's Mansion]

00:30:14.980 --> 00:30:16.440 line:0%
[Imperial Security Bureau]

00:30:15.680 --> 00:30:18.740 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau is investigating a case.

00:30:54.650 --> 00:30:56.110 line:0%
Is Lord Chen Shoujie here?

00:30:56.480 --> 00:30:58.000 line:0%
I am Yan Xing, a scribe from the Ministry of Justice.

00:30:58.000 --> 00:30:59.680 line:0%
I have a few questions for him.

00:31:03.690 --> 00:31:05.750 line:0%
That night, the madam was in a good mood.

00:31:05.750 --> 00:31:06.880 line:0%
She personally cooked,

00:31:06.880 --> 00:31:08.840 line:0%
making water-boiled mutton and smoked chicken.

00:31:08.840 --> 00:31:10.600 line:0%
She also baked flatbread and pilaf.

00:31:10.600 --> 00:31:12.600 line:0%
She even rewarded this old servant with a bowl of wine.

00:31:12.600 --> 00:31:13.760 line:0%
I was sleeping until midnight

00:31:13.760 --> 00:31:14.600 line:0%
when I suddenly heard

00:31:14.600 --> 00:31:15.680 line:0%
the master's screams.

00:31:15.680 --> 00:31:16.610 line:0%
Honey!

00:31:16.740 --> 00:31:18.370 line:0%
As a result, the madam...

00:31:35.190 --> 00:31:36.410 line:0%
[Chen Shoujie]

00:32:06.990 --> 00:32:08.100 line:0%
My Lord.

00:32:08.220 --> 00:32:09.420 line:0%
Be careful.

00:32:17.170 --> 00:32:18.610 line:0%
[Jinxiu Workshop]

00:32:20.600 --> 00:32:22.210 line:0%
Master! Master!

00:32:23.290 --> 00:32:24.200 line:0%
-Master!
-Fire!

00:32:24.200 --> 00:32:25.400 line:0%
Master, master!

00:32:25.400 --> 00:32:26.200 line:0%
There's a fire!

00:32:26.200 --> 00:32:26.840 line:0%
Master!

00:32:26.840 --> 00:32:27.800 line:0%
-Master!
-E.

00:32:27.980 --> 00:32:29.000 line:0%
It's on fire, master!

00:32:29.000 --> 00:32:30.370 line:0%
-Fire!
-Master!

00:32:30.400 --> 00:32:31.550 line:0%
E... E...

00:32:32.730 --> 00:32:34.740 line:0%
Could he be referring to Chen Huo'e?

00:32:34.900 --> 00:32:36.400 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:33:03.640 --> 00:33:05.240 line:0%
Don't get close to everyone.

00:33:09.600 --> 00:33:11.500 line:0%
From now on, you'll sit

00:33:12.640 --> 00:33:13.440 line:0%
here.

00:33:32.530 --> 00:33:35.130 line:0%
Since you're working cases for the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:33:35.130 --> 00:33:36.320 line:0%
you'll no longer have anything

00:33:36.320 --> 00:33:37.640 line:0%
to do with the Ministry of Justice.

00:33:37.640 --> 00:33:41.050 line:0%
No matter how much trouble you cause,

00:33:41.730 --> 00:33:43.980 line:0%
it has nothing to do with the Ministry of Justice.

00:33:43.980 --> 00:33:45.160 line:0%
We at the Ministry of Justice

00:33:45.160 --> 00:33:47.160 line:0%
won't wade into these murky waters.

00:33:50.470 --> 00:33:51.430 line:0%
We won't.

00:34:05.720 --> 00:34:06.520 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:34:07.040 --> 00:34:08.120 line:0%
Let me tell you,

00:34:08.160 --> 00:34:09.240 line:0%
no matter what,

00:34:09.240 --> 00:34:10.160 line:0%
at any time,

00:34:10.200 --> 00:34:11.900 line:0%
you must protect yourself.

00:34:12.950 --> 00:34:14.030 line:0%
If you die,

00:34:14.030 --> 00:34:14.900 line:0%
I will definitely...

00:34:14.900 --> 00:34:16.200 line:0%
I will definitely arrange performances in Furong Garden

00:34:16.200 --> 00:34:17.600 line:0%
for three days straight,

00:34:18.590 --> 00:34:21.019 line:0%
so you won't rest in peace even after death.

00:34:21.689 --> 00:34:22.920 line:0%
Don't worry,

00:34:23.360 --> 00:34:25.430 line:0%
I won't let you have your way.

00:34:38.510 --> 00:34:39.930 line:0%
In the third year of Shengli,

00:34:39.930 --> 00:34:41.080 line:0%
Jinxiu Workshop was accused of treason

00:34:41.080 --> 00:34:43.200 line:0%
summer clothes that exceeded regulations to Princess Runing,

00:34:41.370 --> 00:34:44.570 line:0%
[Case File of Jinxiu Workshop]

00:34:43.400 --> 00:34:45.280 line:0%
committed the crime of insubordination.

00:34:45.280 --> 00:34:47.700 line:0%
As the summer clothes were ordered by the Prince Consort,

00:34:47.650 --> 00:34:48.720 line:0%
[Princess Runing]

00:34:47.880 --> 00:34:51.060 line:0%
Runing's Prince Consort committed suicide in court to atone for the crime.

00:34:51.060 --> 00:34:52.920 line:0%
Since then, Princess Runing

00:34:53.039 --> 00:34:55.880 line:0%
has been at odds with the current Grand Empress Dowager.

00:34:55.880 --> 00:34:56.640 line:0%
As for Jinxiu Workshop,

00:34:56.640 --> 00:34:58.520 line:0%
due to the use of patterns that exceeded regulations,

00:34:58.520 --> 00:35:01.190 line:0%
they committed a grave offense against the royal family and were shut down.

00:35:01.190 --> 00:35:03.610 line:0%
The family of the Jinxiu Workshop owner was executed.

00:35:03.610 --> 00:35:06.200 line:0%
This is known as the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:35:03.690 --> 00:35:06.820 line:0%
[Jinxiu Workshop]

00:35:07.560 --> 00:35:08.440 line:0%
Overruled?

00:35:07.680 --> 00:35:08.510 line:0%
[Case File of Jinxiu Workshop]

00:35:08.840 --> 00:35:10.720 line:0%
Rumors have it that four years ago,

00:35:10.720 --> 00:35:13.050 line:0%
the Prince Consort wanted to show his merits and present a treasure.

00:35:13.050 --> 00:35:15.170 line:0%
Unexpectedly, it led Princess Runing

00:35:15.170 --> 00:35:16.880 line:0%
to mistakenly wear the same

00:35:16.880 --> 00:35:18.440 line:0%
purple chrysanthemum patterned attire as the late Empress.

00:35:18.440 --> 00:35:19.240 line:0%
This angered

00:35:19.240 --> 00:35:20.830 line:0%
the current Grand Empress Dowager.

00:35:20.830 --> 00:35:21.800 line:0%
But in this file,

00:35:21.800 --> 00:35:23.680 line:0%
they only dared to vaguely write it as "exceeding the regulations."

00:35:23.680 --> 00:35:25.920 line:0%
It's clear that the case files can't be fully trusted.

00:35:25.920 --> 00:35:27.920 line:0%
Come and take a look at the pancakes.

00:35:28.120 --> 00:35:28.450 line:0%
Come.

00:35:39.090 --> 00:35:40.550 line:0%
-Mr. Pan.
-Mr. Pan.

00:35:40.930 --> 00:35:42.840 line:0%
I never expected to find someone of your talent here.

00:35:42.840 --> 00:35:44.900 line:0%
You've made it easy for us to find you.

00:35:47.680 --> 00:35:48.760 line:0%
And you two are?

00:35:48.800 --> 00:35:49.800 line:0%
The other day at the Hongwen Academy,

00:35:49.800 --> 00:35:51.520 line:0%
I witnessed your quick wit.

00:35:51.520 --> 00:35:52.120 line:0%
I heard

00:35:52.120 --> 00:35:53.840 line:0%
that you're also taking the Hongwen Academy exam.

00:35:53.840 --> 00:35:54.280 line:0%
In the future,

00:35:54.280 --> 00:35:56.000 line:0%
we'll be fellow students.

00:35:56.920 --> 00:35:58.120 line:0%
I’m flattered.

00:35:58.120 --> 00:35:58.640 line:0%
-Let’s go.
-I’m flattered.

00:35:58.640 --> 00:35:59.770 line:0%
We must have a drink.

00:36:00.080 --> 00:36:01.200 line:0%
-Let’s go.
-Let’s go.

00:36:01.200 --> 00:36:01.840 line:0%
Okay.

00:36:04.560 --> 00:36:06.220 line:0%
-Let’s go.
-This way, please.

00:36:06.240 --> 00:36:07.430 line:0%
After you, Mr. Pan.

00:36:08.440 --> 00:36:09.560 line:0%
Good, good, good.

00:36:09.560 --> 00:36:11.080 line:0%
This is by the order of Prince Xian and Prime Minister Zhang.

00:36:11.080 --> 00:36:12.000 line:0%
They value and cherish talent.

00:36:12.000 --> 00:36:13.200 line:0%
They specifically instructed us

00:36:13.200 --> 00:36:14.880 line:0%
to interact with the scholars from humble backgrounds who are taking the exam

00:36:14.880 --> 00:36:16.320 line:0%
and exchange ideas with them.

00:36:16.320 --> 00:36:17.480 line:0%
So that in the future, we can better

00:36:17.480 --> 00:36:18.720 line:0%
serve the court.

00:36:19.760 --> 00:36:21.000 line:0%
This talented scholar,

00:36:21.000 --> 00:36:21.840 line:0%
please, have a seat.

00:36:21.840 --> 00:36:24.240 line:0%
Please, sit down. No need for formalities.

00:36:25.100 --> 00:36:26.630 line:0%
His Majesty is benevolent.

00:36:26.680 --> 00:36:29.120 line:0%
This Hongwen Academy examination

00:36:29.320 --> 00:36:30.720 line:0%
disregards family background,

00:36:30.720 --> 00:36:32.230 line:0%
ignores social status,

00:36:32.320 --> 00:36:33.880 line:0%
doesn't require recommendations,

00:36:33.880 --> 00:36:36.080 line:0%
and judges solely on virtue and talent.

00:36:36.320 --> 00:36:39.160 line:0%
It can be said to set a precedent for our dynasty,

00:36:39.560 --> 00:36:42.440 line:0%
truly a blessing for scholars.

00:36:42.490 --> 00:36:43.290 line:0%
Indeed.

00:36:43.640 --> 00:36:46.040 line:0%
I have been ordered by Prime Minister Zhang

00:36:46.200 --> 00:36:48.520 line:0%
to prepare some modest wine for your reception.

00:36:48.520 --> 00:36:50.780 line:0%
All you students of the Hongwen Academy,

00:36:50.920 --> 00:36:52.760 line:0%
please take this opportunity

00:36:52.760 --> 00:36:55.420 line:0%
to interact more with these talented scholars.

00:36:57.160 --> 00:36:57.960 line:0%
Come on.

00:36:59.240 --> 00:37:00.800 line:0%
Please.

00:37:01.400 --> 00:37:03.000 line:0%
Come on. A toast to everyone.

00:37:17.300 --> 00:37:18.640 line:0%
What is the meaning of this?

00:37:18.640 --> 00:37:19.800 line:0%
Prince Xian

00:37:19.800 --> 00:37:22.370 line:0%
has always cherished scholars,

00:37:22.610 --> 00:37:24.520 line:0%
fearing that you students

00:37:24.800 --> 00:37:27.000 line:0%
might find your daily life in Xiang'an

00:37:27.200 --> 00:37:28.790 line:0%
not quite convenient.

00:37:29.170 --> 00:37:32.280 line:0%
He has specially sent someone to deliver this modest gift.

00:37:32.280 --> 00:37:33.250 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:37:33.600 --> 00:37:35.680 line:0%
do you see Prince Xian's

00:37:35.720 --> 00:37:37.560 line:0%
benevolence and virtue?

00:37:38.040 --> 00:37:39.000 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:37:39.320 --> 00:37:41.520 line:0%
please do accept it.

00:37:41.650 --> 00:37:44.110 line:0%
So this is the sincerity of your noble class.

00:37:47.890 --> 00:37:48.850 line:0%
Mr. Pan.

00:37:50.170 --> 00:37:52.700 line:0%
He dares to disrespect Prime Minister Zhang?

00:37:54.150 --> 00:37:56.150 line:0%
He doesn't know what's good for him.

00:37:56.440 --> 00:37:58.500 line:0%
The rich feast while the poor starve.

00:37:58.580 --> 00:38:00.430 line:0%
Using such despicable means

00:38:00.560 --> 00:38:02.690 line:0%
to bribe and corrupt people's hearts.

00:38:39.580 --> 00:38:40.820 line:0%
You poor boy,

00:38:41.280 --> 00:38:44.010 line:0%
don't refuse the easy way and choose the hard way.

00:38:44.400 --> 00:38:46.220 line:0%
You're Prime Minister Zhang's men?

00:38:46.220 --> 00:38:48.550 line:0%
If bribery fails, you resort to violence.

00:38:50.020 --> 00:38:52.020 line:0%
How dare you say that?

00:38:52.710 --> 00:38:53.930 line:0%
How dare you?

00:38:59.360 --> 00:39:00.440 line:0%
Xiang'an City

00:39:00.440 --> 00:39:01.660 line:0%
is right under the Emperor's nose,

00:39:01.660 --> 00:39:02.960 line:0%
You'd better soften your knees.

00:39:02.960 --> 00:39:04.680 line:0%
That way, you'll suffer less.

00:39:04.700 --> 00:39:06.100 line:0%
Be smart about this.

00:39:17.400 --> 00:39:18.660 line:0%
And who are you people?

00:39:18.920 --> 00:39:20.440 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang shows womanly mercy,

00:39:20.440 --> 00:39:21.800 line:0%
but Prince Xian is wise.

00:39:21.920 --> 00:39:23.520 line:0%
You poor, pathetic scholars,

00:39:23.520 --> 00:39:25.180 line:0%
threats and bribes won't work on you.

00:39:25.180 --> 00:39:26.510 line:0%
You'd better be killed.

00:39:27.480 --> 00:39:28.720 line:0%
We just don't want to serve

00:39:28.720 --> 00:39:30.390 line:0%
under Prime Minister Zhang and Prince Xian.

00:39:30.390 --> 00:39:32.450 line:0%
Does that mean we have to be silenced?

00:39:33.000 --> 00:39:33.800 line:0%
Kill them!

00:40:04.490 --> 00:40:07.080 line:0%
Prince Xian won't let you off.

00:40:12.020 --> 00:40:12.580 line:0%
Hya!

00:40:35.930 --> 00:40:37.080 line:0%
It's you.

00:40:39.820 --> 00:40:41.210 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:40:45.480 --> 00:40:46.440 line:0%
Watch out!

00:41:09.000 --> 00:41:11.310 line:0%
[Guanyin Hall]

00:42:46.980 --> 00:42:48.540 line:0%
This person's hidden strength is formidable.

00:42:48.540 --> 00:42:51.000 line:0%
The force of his concealed weapons is powerful and vicious.

00:42:51.000 --> 00:42:51.930 line:0%
Be careful.

00:42:52.200 --> 00:42:52.680 line:0%
Yes.

00:42:53.320 --> 00:42:54.100 line:0%
After them!

00:42:54.360 --> 00:42:54.880 line:0%
Hurry!

00:43:08.840 --> 00:43:09.850 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:43:20.290 --> 00:43:21.440 line:0%
I don't know who

00:43:21.560 --> 00:43:23.920 line:0%
pinned this note to the corridor pillar.

00:43:26.840 --> 00:43:28.080 line:0%
[Tonight, the poor family is destroyed]